Ralph Loop init

Usage: ralph-loop init [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --output <OUTPUT>
          Output format
          
          [possible values: text, json]

      --base-branch <BASE_BRANCH>
          Base branch to branch from
          
          [default: main]

      --work-branch <WORK_BRANCH>
          Working branch name

      --dry-run
          Validate and describe the init without side effects

  -h, --help
          Print help

  -V, --version
          Print version
